sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant PX as Proxy
    participant AU as Auth
    participant TN as Tenant context
    participant PS as Permission snapshot
    participant UC as Use case
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant OB as Outbox relay
    participant HU as SignalR
    U->>PX: Request board page
    PX->>AU: Validate cookie or bearer token
    AU-->>TN: Principal with membership claim
    TN->>PS: Resolve tenant, load grants
    Note over PS: four indexed reads<br/>role, workspace, board, item
    PS-->>UC: Effective permission
    UC->>UC: Validate command
    UC->>DB: Begin transaction
    UC->>DB: Write state, outbox, audit
    DB-->>UC: Commit
    UC-->>HU: Notify board group
    HU-->>U: Live update to other clients
    UC-->>U: Rendered response
    Note over OB,DB: asynchronous relay, after commit
    OB->>DB: Poll undelivered outbox
    OB->>OB: Dispatch integration events
